Apply the exact gate to RestorationOption: Known ecological and access constraints respected; no unsupported intervention prescription. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
